### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List stock movements (with filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements
Accept: application/json

### Filter by movement type (in_purchase, out_usage, out_borrow, etc.)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements?type=in_purchase
Accept: application/json

### Filter by item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements?item_id=1
Accept: application/json

### Get movement history for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/stock-movements
Accept: application/json

### Get incoming movements only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements?type=in_purchase,in_return,in_adjustment
Accept: application/json

### Get outgoing movements only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements?type=out_usage,out_borrow,out_disposal
Accept: application/json

### Create purchase movement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_id": 1,
  "type": "in_purchase",
  "quantity": 50.00,
  "notes": "Pembelian baru dari supplier ABC",
  "occurred_at": "2026-08-07T10:00:00.000000Z"
}

### Create usage movement (bahan consumed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_id": 5,
  "type": "out_usage",
  "quantity": 29.94,
  "notes": "Penggunaan untuk analisis sampel air"
}

### Create disposal movement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_id": 10,
  "type": "out_disposal",
  "quantity": 5.00,
  "notes": "Bahan kadaluarsa dibuang"
}

### Get stock balance for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/stock-balance
Accept: application/json

### Reconcile stock (GET current reconciliation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-reconciliation
Accept: application/json